WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.975
ALEX: What does that tell you?

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.572
RUFUS: That they're building
institutional scaffolding they never
needed when Jensen was the

00:00:03.572 --> 00:00:06.083
RUFUS: institution.

00:00:06.296 --> 00:00:08.707
JAMIE: Which is either reassuring or
slightly terrifying, depending on how
you look

00:00:08.707 --> 00:00:11.118
JAMIE: at it.

00:00:11.228 --> 00:00:15.275
ALEX: I keep going back and forth on
that. Because on one hand

00:00:15.275 --> 00:00:19.323
ALEX: — NVIDIA's order book is enormous.
The product roadmap exists. Colette
Kress

00:00:19.323 --> 00:00:23.370
ALEX: has been CFO since 2013. She knows
this company.
